  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><u>About our brand and products.</u></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Richdkidk luxuries isa premium fashion and accessories brand focused on modern luxury, bold style, and high-quality craftsmanship. our products are designed for trend-setters who value confidence, exclusivity, and standout looks at accessible prices.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><u>what makes us different</u><u>:</u></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">we combine luxury aesthetics with affordable pricing, fast shipping, and strong customer support. our brand is built for social media-ready fashion that converts well for content creators. </p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">How affiliates can earn: </p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Affiliates earn competitive commission on every sale made through their unique referral link, with real-time tracking and transparent payouts.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">How to promote us: </p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">you can promote our products through social media, blogs, videos, reviews, and paid ads [where allowed]. </p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Other information: </p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">we welcome influencers, creators, bloggers, and marketers worldwide to grow with us. </p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><